It is a maven project

CREATE A FOLDER NAME resources AND ADD THE FILE spring.xml(file name can be anything)
spring.xml

Search on chrome = spring bean configuration xml file
AND ADD configuration

ye line object create karta hai
    ApplicationContext context = new ClassPathXmlApplicationContext("spring.xml");

    AND WE ALSO NEED TO ADD THESE LINES IN SPRING.XML FILE FOR OBJECT CREATION
        <bean id="alien" class="org.example.Alien">
        </bean>


Aur ye line object call karta hai
    context.getBean("alien");

// SCOPES - .Singleton .Prototype

BY DEFAULT THE SCOPE IS SINGLETON.

so when we write once -- <bean id="alien" class="org.example.Alien"></bean>
             AND
    Alien obj1 = (Alien) context.getBean("alien");
            obj1.code();
            obj1.age = 21;
            System.out.println(obj1.age);

    Call two times it creates only one object and call the same object again and again

     Alien obj2 = (Alien) context.getBean("alien");
            obj2.code();
            System.out.println(obj2.age);

JAB HUM SCOPE KO CHANGE KAR DENGE PROTOTYPE

<bean id="alien" class="org.example.Alien" scope="prototype">
</bean>

to ab jab bhi app ke under
Alien obj1 = (Alien) context.getBean("alien");
CALL KIYA JAYEGA TO HAR BAAR EK NAYA OBJECT CREATE HOGA

